From f1778081a8ae82c2c234f7f80a3097b59293c899 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: m5agent <m5agent@m5stack.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 23:32:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] hw/m5stopwatch: add Unit batch-6 first six data planes

Add the first six batch-6 Units on top of the 20-layer canonical tree. No
guest evidence is recorded; all six stay planned and the new sensor
machines are deliberately minimal with explicit catalog blockers.

- mini-scales (U177): CONTROL_MINISCALE at 0x26 with u32 LE ADC, float LE
  weight, signed button (0=pressed), RGB, calibration-gap float, reset and
  low-pass/average/EMA filter registers. The 5kg load-cell mechanics are NOT
  modeled; 0x26 has a four-way product conflict.
- rgb-led-strip-50cm (A093): 30-SK6812 RMT capture on the yellow data line;
  PORT.B host availability is a blocker and the adapter wire order is
  unresolved.
- op180 (U058): white digital-input observation sharing the OP90 GPIO
  transaction model (same unit/op.py driver); the 180-degree optics/mechanics
  differ and results are not transferred between products.
- synth (U178): TX-only UART 31250 capture (white NC, no RX injection);
  SAM2695 audio synthesis is NOT modeled.
- mini-imu (U095): US_MPU6886 at 0x68 with WHOAMI 0x19, accel/gyro/temp data
  registers derived from fixtures using the driver scale factors, range
  configuration and address migration; DMP/FIFO and real motion are NOT
  modeled.
- env-pro (U169): US_BME68X at 0x77 with WHOAMI 0x61, variant, soft-reset,
  control/status/calibration register storage and synthetic 17-byte field
  data; the BME68x compensation inverse, gas/IAQ/heater behavior are NOT
  modeled and guest decode is not asserted.

Offline QOM smoke (S3 board, no guest firmware) validates property
registration, fixtures, range/read-only rejection and the 30-LED shape; it is
not a functional PASS.
